# IfcOpenShell for the schema checks: CI's IfcOpenShell job and Measure.
# Dependabot proposes updates (.github/dependabot.yml).
# requirements-ifc.txt pins this and every dependency with its hashes, and pip
# installs it with --require-hashes; after changing a pin here, regenerate it
# with the uv command at its top. IfcOpenShell is a
# witness: an update lands with its observations and verdicts under
# research/witness/ refreshed from the CI run's octetproof-core-interior
# artifact, and with Measure's scores unchanged on the same commit. 0.9.0.post1
# was measured on 2026-10-18 (#773): once the scorers keep each file bound,
# every scorer output on main's commit is the one 0.8.5 gives.
ifcopenshell==0.9.0.post1
# IfcOpenShell's EXPRESS rule check (ifcopenshell.express.rule_executor, Measure's
# `rules:` section) imports pytest's assertion rewriter.
pytest
